From: Ubuntu Desktop bug work
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: search-style: do not splice(-1) when indexOf misses

Same class as LP #2161808: Array.splice(-1, 1) removes the last
unrelated entry. Guard every remaining gnome-shell indexOf+splice
that lacked an index check, including app-folder deletion (can drop
the wrong folder from org.gnome.desktop.app-folders) and the logout
inhibitor list.

Forwarded: no
